    {
      "id": "case-outdated-extends-chain-differential",
      "behaviors": [
        "bhv-outdated-extends-chain-features"
      ],
      "context": [],
      "scenarioContext": {
        "sdim-operation": "outdated",
        "sdim-config-source": "image",
        "sdim-container-state": "none",
        "sdim-features": "single",
        "sdim-layering": "extends-chain",
        "sdim-output-mode": "human"
      },
      "inputClass": "reference-lenient",
      "oracleType": "live-differential",
      "operations": [
        {
          "id": "op-outdated",
          "subcommand": "outdated",
          "argv": [
            "--workspace-folder",
            "${WORKSPACE}"
          ],
          "fixtures": [
            "fx-outdated-extends-feature"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "channel": "chan-stdout",
          "operation": "op-outdated"
        }
      ],
      "allowedDifferences": [
        {
          "behavior": "bhv-outdated-extends-chain-features",
          "context": [],
          "observablePath": "chan-stdout.table",
          "rationale": "deacon resolves the extends chain before reporting Feature versions, so it lists the Feature the base link declares; the reference does not resolve `extends` and reports an empty table.",
          "waiverId": "wvr-outdated-extends-chain-features"
        }
      ],
      "cleanup": {
        "tempdir": true
      },
      "notes": "The differential half: the pinned reference does not resolve `extends`, so it reports an EMPTY table for a workspace whose Feature is declared one link up, while deacon reports the Feature. Both exit 0 — the difference is only visible on stdout, which is why that is the compared channel here and the exit code is not."
    },
    {
      "id": "case-outdated-extends-chain-features",
      "behaviors": [
        "bhv-outdated-extends-chain-features"
      ],
      "context": [],
      "scenarioContext": {
        "sdim-operation": "outdated",
        "sdim-config-source": "image",
        "sdim-container-state": "none",
        "sdim-features": "single",
        "sdim-layering": "extends-chain",
        "sdim-output-mode": "human"
      },
      "inputClass": "valid",
      "oracleType": "spec-expectation",
      "operations": [
        {
          "id": "op-outdated",
          "subcommand": "outdated",
          "argv": [
            "--workspace-folder",
            "${WORKSPACE}"
          ],
          "fixtures": [
            "fx-outdated-extends-feature"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "channel": "chan-exit-code",
          "operation": "op-outdated",
          "assertion": {
            "equals": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "channel": "chan-stdout",
          "operation": "op-outdated",
          "assertion": {
            "matches": "ghcr\\.io/devcontainers/features/git\\s*\\|\\s*1\\.3\\.2\\s*\\|\\s*1\\.3\\.2\\s*\\|"
          }
        }
      ],
      "cleanup": {
        "tempdir": true
      },
      "notes": "Covers the high-risk triple `hrt-outdated-extends-chain-image-single-feature`. The chain's BASE link contributes the only Feature, so an implementation that reads the top document alone reports an empty table and exits 0 — a silent miss, not an error. The regex pins the row's identifier and both pinned columns while leaving `latest` free."
    },
